#: src/configpage.cpp:91
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \\newcommand lines written here are available in the formulas of every "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Baris \\newcommand yang ditulis di sini tersedia dalam rumus di setiap "
"dokumen."

